<td id="S2.T1.3.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="S2.T1.3.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Depth Estimation</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.3.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Return depth map in colorful style</td>
