<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Case Study</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We show some case studies that our model successfully using tools in Figure <a href="#A3.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> ,<a href="#A3.F10" title="Figure 10 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> ,<a href="#A3.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> and <a href="#A3.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>. We also include some failure cases that visual tools return wrong output and disturb model’s reasoning chain in <a href="#A3.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, <a href="#A3.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> and <a href="#A3.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix C Case Study ‣ Reinforced Visual Perception with Tools" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.F9" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="850.91" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700.39 850.91" width="700.39"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,850.91) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#808080;" fill="#808080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.18 L 0 845.73 C 0 848.59 2.32 850.91 5.18 850.91 L 695.21 850.91 C 698.07 850.91 700.39 848.59 700.39 845.73 L 700.39 5.18 C 700.39 2.32 698.07 0 695.21 0 L 5.18 0 C 2.32 0 0 2.32 0 5.18 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.25 5.18 L 1.25 845.73 C 1.25 847.9 3.01 849.67 5.18 849.67 L 695.21 849.67 C 697.39 849.67 699.15 847.9 699.15 845.73 L 699.15 5.18 C 699.15 3.01 697.39 1.25 695.21 1.25 L 5.18 1.25 C 3.01 1.25 1.25 3.01 1.25 5.18 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#808080;" fill-opacity="1.0" stroke="#808080" stroke-dasharray="2.84528pt,2.84528pt" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 1.25 299.19 L 699.15 299.19"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.93 311)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.59em;--ltx-fo-height:38.08em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="526.86" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 526.86)" width="658.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.59em;">
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:475.9pt;">
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Question</span><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Considering the relative positions of the bottle (annotated by the red box) and the fork in the image provided, where is the bottle (annotated by the red box) located with respect to the fork?</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(A) left (B) right</span></span>
<span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Answer</span><span id="A3.F9.pic1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: (B)</span></span>
